{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "main_2_level_main_02-01_end",
  "groupId": "main_2",
  "stageId": "main_02-01",
  "title": "龙门之行",
  "storyCode": "2-1",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_02-01_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "816bf7903d3130eb5200cc98de192e1bca3465d617ff76fa0dde3f387e36ab58",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第十三关（后）\n10:14 p.m. \\ 晴 \\ 能见度 19公里\n龙门5区外 检疫口"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "长官。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "他们来了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "广播",
      "text": "请注意——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "广播",
      "text": "受天灾影响，龙门全域处于停航状态。龙门5区所有入城关口将于2小时后关闭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "广播",
      "text": "请积极配合工作人员进行矿石病检疫。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "广播",
      "text": "一旦发现任何未经登记的感染者，请广大市民立刻向最近的警员通报，",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "广播",
      "text": "近卫局将依照《紧急处理法案》依法对其进行拘捕。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "广播",
      "text": "请注意——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "和传闻中一样......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "走吧，博士。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "我们到了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "罗德岛与近卫局约好在十点见面。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "现在是十点十四。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "你们迟到了十四分钟，无谓地浪费了我十四分钟时间。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "......抱歉，陈长官，这片区域刚才有整合————",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "行了，我知道。不过这些都不重要。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "——这个人是？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "Dr.{@nickname}是罗德岛的顾问。凯尔希医生应该通知过龙门的各位。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "哼.......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "好了，人已经到齐，现在你们需要跟我去见——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局队员",
      "text": "陈长官！不好了！不好——感染者——那又——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "慌什么！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "一队，戒备！狙击队员，就位！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普通市民",
      "text": "发生，发生什么了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "text": "放开我！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "啧......怎么回事，汇报情况。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "text": "让我过去！！为什么要抓我！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "text": "我们不是怪物！！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局队员",
      "text": "有感染者——不服从管理——我们——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "......我自己都看到了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "算了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "把他们全部拘押。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "立刻疏散人群，半小时后通过复查流程后，再开放关口。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "还有，把检疫口检查线向前推四十米。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "罗德岛的，除了你和Dr.{@nickname}，其他人不需要一起同行，留在这里协助龙门边防进行驻守。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "要是连这点小事都处理不好，无论是什么任务，我可都没法交给你们。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "PC94172，你给这些人安排一下任务，今晚不要再出乱子了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局队员",
      "text": "明白，陈警司！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局队员",
      "text": "诸位，请注意......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "（陈长官真的很严格......比我想象的要严格......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......（点头）",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "陈",
          "text": "你们，",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "陈",
          "text": "跟我来。——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "陈",
          "text": "到了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "好，好高的建筑！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "陈",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "唔......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "对，对不......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "陈",
          "text": "——罗德岛的身手还算不错。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "啊......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "谢谢陈长官夸奖。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "陈",
          "text": "只不过——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "陈",
          "text": "切尔诺伯格事件发生之后，什么人都疯了一样地向龙门跑。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "陈",
          "text": "感染者就该清楚，来龙门会有什么下场。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "text": "我再提醒你一次。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "text": "龙门就是下一个切尔诺伯格。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "是凯尔希医生......！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "陈",
          "text": "你们罗德岛的代表已经和魏长官先行接触了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "陈",
          "text": "在这里等着。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "陈",
          "text": "我一会儿通知你们。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "呼......那个陈警官，真的很难应付呢。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "博士，接下来的交涉就交给凯尔希医生。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "请相信她吧。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
